sequenceDiagram
    participant Site as Website
    participant Page as PageScript isolate
    participant Engine as Engine Worker CDP
    participant CLI as Rust CLI
    participant Wasm as Wasm rasterizer
    participant TTY as Terminal

    CLI->>Engine: HTTP GET /rbi/scene_host.json and scene_host.wasm
    Engine-->>CLI: Versioned rasterizer code, no font files
    CLI->>Engine: CDP WebSocket attach and set viewport
    CLI->>Engine: Start scene stream, then navigate
    Engine->>Site: Fetch document
    Site-->>Engine: HTML response
    Engine->>Page: Build DOM and run page JavaScript
    Page->>Engine: Request subresources
    Engine->>Site: Fetch styles, scripts, images
    Site-->>Engine: Subresource responses
    Engine-->>Page: Deliver resources
    Note over Page,Engine: CSS sans-serif uses Kitesurf's built-in Noto Sans

    loop Changed page, up to requested FPS and two unacked frames
        Engine->>Page: recordScene
        Page-->>Engine: Drawing commands and resource batch
        Engine-->>CLI: Kitesurf.sceneFrame with base64 scene envelope
        CLI->>Wasm: Ingest inline resources and check missing hashes
        opt Missing image or font resource
            CLI->>Engine: Kitesurf.getSceneResources
            Engine-->>CLI: CDP resource batch with font asset path or font bytes
            CLI->>Wasm: Ingest resource batch
        end
        opt Built-in Noto Sans asset needed
            Wasm-->>CLI: Pending font asset /fonts/NotoSans.ttf
            CLI->>Engine: HTTP GET /rbi/fonts/NotoSans.ttf
            Engine-->>CLI: Noto Sans font file bytes
            CLI->>Wasm: Register font bytes for pending asset
        end
        Note over Engine,Wasm: Author fonts from @font-face arrive as bytes in the CDP batch
        CLI->>Wasm: Decode resources, replay scene, rasterize
        Wasm-->>CLI: RGBA pixels or PNG / ANSI text
        CLI->>TTY: Kitty image or selectable ANSI text
        CLI->>Engine: Kitesurf.sceneFrameAck returns stream credit
    end

    TTY-->>CLI: Keyboard, mouse, resize
    CLI->>Engine: CDP Input events and viewport updates
    Engine->>Page: Deliver input and record the next scene
